# Ghost — what we are building

## Core product (priority #1): Ghost Gas (prepaid)

1. **X1** deposits USDC → Ghost treasury → gets a **gas note** (`ghost-gas:v1:…`).
2. **X2** (tokens, often 0 SOL) wants to send to **A1**.
3. X2 signs the SPL transfer and presents the **gas note**.
4. Relayer is `feePayer` (pays SOL) and **debits the note** (flat USDC fee per send).

No SOL from X1 → X2 (that link is the leak). X1 prepays Ghost; X2 spends the credit.

APIs: `/v1/gas/credits/deposit`, `/v1/gas/prepare`, `/v1/gas/submit` (gasNote required).  
UI: `/app/credits` (X1 top-up), `/app/send` (X2 + note).

## Secondary: Ghost Shield

Fixed 1 USDC private pool (deposit note → ZK withdraw). Optional private on-ramp — not the main story.

## Trust

Relayer-trusted for gas debit + withdraw. Malicious relayer risk is real. Keep allowlists/fees tight.

## Copy

Do not put “Devnet” in user-facing UI. Wallets via Reown AppKit (`useGhostWallet`).
